  "description": "NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients provides a Standard compliant client for recording\n\t\t\taudits, metrics and security audits. Writes are validated and stamped on the caller's\n\t\t\tthread and dispatched in the background, and completed metric spans are replayed to an\n\t\t\tActivitySource for telemetry. Storage, identity and request tracing are supplied by the host through the\n\t\t\tNHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Abstractions ports.",
