  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.0.0\n\t\t\t- Breaking: adds security audits, a record of access decisions. IAuditAndMetricsClient has a new SecurityAuditClient to log, record, add, bulk add, retrieve, modify, remove and purge them, and AuditAndMetricsConfigurations has IsSecurityAuditEnabled, IsSecurityAuditPurgingAllowed (false by default) and SecurityAuditRetentionPeriodInDays. Hosts must implement the new security audit members of IAuditAndMetricStorageBroker.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: the audit purge is off by default. Set IsAuditPurgingAllowed to true to keep purging audits.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: the bulk methods take IEnumerable<T> rather than List<T>, and read the sequence exactly once.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: IMetric inherits IKey, as IAudit does.\n\t\t\t- AuditAndMetricsClient is disposable, and disposes the container it builds for itself.\n\t\t\t- A cancellation passes through every layer untouched.\n\t\t\t- Installing the package no longer asks you to accept the licence.\n\t\t\t- Upgrade guide: https://github.com/NHSISL/NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics#upgrading-from-01x",
